{"sections":[{"slug":"OpAlgMod","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"OpAlgMod"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴上的代数上的模</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"算畴上的代数上的模"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于单色</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">可以谈论</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这种模是如下的一个新的算畴</span> $\\tilde{\\mathcal O}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的代数</span>:</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $a$ <span lang=\"zh\">为算畴</span> $\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">唯一的颜色</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">添加第二种颜色</span> $m$, <span lang=\"zh\">并且对每种运算</span> $a^n\\to a$, <span lang=\"zh\">用</span> $m$ <span lang=\"zh\">代替左边的一个</span> $a$ <span lang=\"zh\">和右边的</span> $a$, <span lang=\"zh\">得到一种新的运算</span> $a\\cdots a m a\\cdots a \\to m$, <span lang=\"zh\">即得到算畴</span> $\\tilde{\\mathcal O}$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/A∞-算畴","text":"$\\mathbb E_1$"}},{"Plain":"-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":") $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">其上的模即为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">泛包络代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span> $\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的代数</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的模等同于一个结合代数上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">左模</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">这个结合代数称为</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/泛包络代数(算畴)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">泛包络代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal UA$. "},{"Local":{"url":"/泛包络代数","text":"Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数的泛包络代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是这个概念的特例</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}